Z||000001||AusFiero||06-02-2001||04:20 AM||||We have a site like that in Australia to enlist cars too. Thankfully ours is free though. A friend has had is 94 Camaro in a couple of TV ads and a movie. Warner Bros Movieworld on the Gold Coast hires a lot of American cars as does Fox studios in Sydney for the American movies they make using Australian streets as the setting. More work for left hand drivers though and mine is already converted.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||1
